# Re - Traveller : demo release trigger
#
# This file is not code. Pushing a change to it runs .github/workflows/release-demo.yml,
# which builds the six game packages plus the launcher APK and publishes them as a
# GitHub Release (so the launcher's default MANIFEST_URL resolves to it).
#
# Why a file instead of only workflow_dispatch: GitHub only exposes manual
# dispatch for workflows that exist on the default branch. The path trigger works
# from this branch, which means the demo can be rebuilt from a phone by editing
# one line here.
